## PasskeyPromo
## Shown right after a web signup or sign-in, to an account with no passkey. Offers to create one.

page-passkey-promo-success-banner = You’re signed in
page-passkey-promo-signup-banner = Your account is ready
page-passkey-promo-description-v2 = Next time, use your fingerprint, face or device PIN to authenticate.
